  "translation": "And the king of Israel said to Jehoshaphat, “Still there is one man by whom to inquire of ⟨את⟩ YHWH ⟨את⟩ from him, but I hate him, for he does not prophesy over me good but evil — Micaiah son of Imlah.” And Jehoshaphat said, “Let not the king say so.”",
